            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Fixes Node.js CLI launching by prioritizing local Node paths and clearly explaining missing or outdated Node runtimes. Allows dropping images directly into the prompt box to attach them. Streamlines license activation with key visibility toggling and automatic format validation. Adds context size and token breakdown logging for executor prompts. Refines volume control steps to 10% and adds 'get louder' and 'get quieter' voice phrases.
]]></description>
